                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2017-14159\nSeverity: low\nPackage: libldap2\nVersion: 2.6.14+dfsg-2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:unstable\nLink: [CVE-2017-14159](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2017-14159)",
